<title>USA: FCNB Corp Q3 shr rises to $0.54.</title>
<headline>FCNB Corp Q3 shr rises to $0.54.</headline>
<dateline>FREDERICK, Md. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.54		    $0.39</p>
